  "_comment": "Frame-check verdicts. Expected values come from the HTML X-Frame-Options processing model and CSP3 frame-ancestors, with the embedder as the only ancestor. Precedence: blocked, then insecure (final URL not https), then unknown (no embedder), then allowed. Go (internal/framecheck) and C# (FrameCheckVerdictFixtureTests) both read this file.",
